        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Upper MARCHIONESS OF ABERDEEN\nLower LORD ABERDEEN\nLord Aberdeen, former Governor-\nGeneral of Canada and Governor of\nIreland, and the Marchioness of\nAberdeen, are in America for an\nextended visit. Lord Aberdeen went\nto America to attend the International Architectural Exposition in\nNew York. The Marchioness is\npresident of the International Council\nof Women, comprising thirty-six\nnations and having a membership of\n81,000,000. She will attend the sixth\nquinquennial convention of the\nsociety, to be held in Washington.\n\nJAIL FOR CONTEMPT OF COURT",
